PURPOSE
  Record of all demo payments made. Patient can download receipts for
  their own records.

SECTIONS
  Table: Date | Booking ID | Amount INR | Amount USD | Status | Receipt
  Status: Success (green) | Failed (red) | Pending (amber)
  Receipt column: "Download PDF" link
  Note at top: "All transactions are demo payments. No real money was charged."


━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
PAGE 20 — AFTERCARE & FOLLOW-UP
Route: /dashboard/aftercare
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

PURPOSE
  Keeps the patient engaged and supported after they return home.
  Post-treatment care is a major trust-builder and differentiator.

SECTIONS
  Post-treatment checklist (treatment-specific): tick off completed steps
  Medication reminders (name, dose, time — entered by concierge)
  Teleconsultation schedule (Phase 2: video call booking)
  Recovery progress (simple: "Week 1 of 12 recovery weeks")
  Write a Review (prompt appears 7 days post-discharge)

KEY UI
  Checklist items tick with animation (green checkmark fills in)
  Review prompt is a card with star selector and text area


━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
PAGE 21 — MY PROFILE
Route: /dashboard/profile
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

