PAGES 22–28 — HOSPITAL PARTNER DASHBOARD
Route prefix: /partner/
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

PURPOSE OF PARTNER DASHBOARD
  Hospital admins manage their MediTrip presence and handle incoming
  patient bookings. This is a B2B tool — functional over flashy.

/partner/dashboard
  Summary: Total bookings this month, pending confirmations, revenue (demo),
  patient count by country (bar chart)

/partner/profile
  Edit: hospital name, description, city, contact info, specialties,
  accreditations, gallery image upload (up to 10 images)

/partner/doctors
  Table of doctors linked to this hospital
  Add doctor: name, specialty, photo, languages, qualifications, bio
  Edit/delete existing doctors

/partner/bookings
  Table: Booking ID | Patient Country | Treatment | Doctor | Travel Dates |
  Status | Actions
  Actions: Confirm | Reject (with notes field) | View Details
  Status filter: Pending | Confirmed | In Progress | Completed | Cancelled

/partner/packages
  Table of packages created by this hospital
  Create/edit package: title, treatment, inclusions toggles, hotel tier,
  price INR, duration days, availability toggle

/partner/messages
  Same chat UI as patient but from hospital side
  Shows all patient chats linked to their hospital's bookings

/partner/analytics
  Monthly bookings trend (line chart)
  Patient country breakdown (pie chart or bar chart)
  Top treatments booked
  Conversion: views → bookings rate


━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
PAGES 29–38 — ADMIN PANEL
Route prefix: /1234/admin/
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

PURPOSE OF ADMIN PANEL
  Internal tool for MediTrip team (Avaneesh / Abhishek) to run the platform.
  Basic UI only. No unnecessary design. Functional, readable tables and forms.

ADMIN SETUP (first time only)
  Visit /1234/admin/setup
  Create admin email + password
  This page becomes inaccessible after first admin is created
  Admin credentials stored in Supabase auth with role = admin
  No self-registration for admin — fixed after setup

ADMIN LOGIN
  Route: /1234/admin/login
  Email + Password only
  No "Forgot Password" on this page — password is fixed
  On wrong credentials: "Invalid admin credentials"

─────────────────────────────────────
ADMIN LAYOUT
─────────────────────────────────────
  Left sidebar (dark #0F172A, 220px wide):
    MediTrip Admin (logo + label)
    Nav links: Dashboard | Users | Hospitals | Doctors | Bookings |
    Packages | Payments | Blog | Support | Settings | Logout
  Top bar: current page title + admin email display
  Content area: white/light gray background

─────────────────────────────────────
/1234/admin/dashboard — Analytics Overview
─────────────────────────────────────
PURPOSE: Single screen showing the health of the entire platform.

METRICS CARDS ROW
  Total Users | Total Hospitals | Total Bookings |
  Revenue This Month (demo) | Active Bookings | Pending Approvals

CHARTS
  Line chart: Bookings per month (last 6 months)
  Bar chart: Bookings by source country
  Pie chart: Bookings by treatment type
  Table: Last 10 bookings (ID, patient, hospital, status, date)

CHARTS LIBRARY: Recharts (lightweight, works with React)

─────────────────────────────────────
/1234/admin/users — User Management
─────────────────────────────────────
PURPOSE: View and manage all registered patients.

TABLE COLUMNS
  ID | Name | Email | Country | Role | Joined Date | Status | Actions

ACTIONS
  View: opens side panel with full profile details
  Edit: inline edit or modal — name, country, role, status
  Suspend: sets status = suspended (user cannot login)
  Delete: confirmation dialog → hard delete from Supabase
  Search: by name or email
  Filter: by country, role, status, join date range

─────────────────────────────────────
/1234/admin/hospitals — Hospital Management
─────────────────────────────────────
PURPOSE: Approve partner hospitals and manage their listings.

TABLE COLUMNS
  ID | Hospital Name | City | Status | Accreditation | Rating | Joined | Actions

STATUS VALUES
  Pending → Approved → Suspended
  Admin can move between any status

ACTIONS
  Approve: changes status to approved, hospital becomes publicly visible
  Reject: changes status to rejected with a reason note
  Suspend: hides from public listing
  Edit: edit any hospital field directly
  Delete: removes hospital and all linked doctors/packages

─────────────────────────────────────
/1234/admin/doctors — Doctor Verification
─────────────────────────────────────
TABLE COLUMNS
  ID | Name | Specialty | Hospital | Status | Added Date | Actions

ACTIONS
  Verify: marks doctor as verified (gets verified badge on public profile)
  Unverify | Edit | Delete

─────────────────────────────────────
/1234/admin/bookings — All Bookings
─────────────────────────────────────
TABLE COLUMNS
  Booking ID | Patient | Hospital | Treatment | Doctor | Status |
  Travel Dates | Amount | Actions

ACTIONS
  View full booking details (side panel)
  Change status manually (dropdown: any status)
  Assign or reassign concierge
  Add internal note (not visible to patient)
  Download booking as PDF

FILTERS
  Status | Date range | Hospital | Treatment | Country

─────────────────────────────────────
/1234/admin/payments — Payment Log
─────────────────────────────────────
TABLE COLUMNS
  Payment ID | Booking ID | Patient | Amount INR | Amount USD |
  Status | Card Last 4 | Date

Note at top: "All payments are demo transactions. No real money processed."
Filter by: Status | Date range | Amount range

