/1234/admin/blog — Blog CMS
─────────────────────────────────────
PURPOSE: Manage blog content for SEO and patient education.

TABLE: Title | Status | Author | Created | Actions (Edit, Publish, Delete)
Create/Edit: Title | Slug (auto-generated) | Body (rich text) | 
Featured Image | Tags | Status (Draft / Published)
Rich text editor: use React-Quill (simple, no complex setup)

─────────────────────────────────────
/1234/admin/support — Support Tickets
─────────────────────────────────────
TABLE: Ticket ID | Patient | Booking ID | Issue | Status | Created | Actions

STATUS: Open | In Progress | Resolved
Admin can: Reply (via email trigger), Change status, Assign to self, Close

